        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Trevor Devall, Paul McCartney\n- Works: Black Lagoon, No-Name, \"Rocky Raccoon\"\n- Characters: Dutch, Rocky Raccoon\n- Topics: Voice acting, fictional universes\n\nFacts:\n- Paul McCartney wrote the song \"Rocky Raccoon.\"\n- The fictional universe inspired by Paul McCartney’s song \"Rocky Raccoon\" includes No-Name.\n- Trevor Devall is best known for voicing Dutch in Black Lagoon.\n- Dutch shares his name with a character from the fictional universe that includes No-Name.",
