        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "b1e3f42c-7959-5bbe-bfb5-0f46f4a71197",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rocket Raccoon, Paul McCartney, John Lennon, Donovan, Trevor Devall\n- Songs: \"Rocky Raccoon\"\n- Places: India\n- TV Series: \"Guardians of the Galaxy\", \"Lego Star Wars\", \"X-Men Evolution\", \"Johnny Test\", \"F Is for Family\"\n- Anime Series: \"Mobile Suit Gundam SEED\", \"InuYasha\", \"Black Lagoon\", \"Death Note\"\n- Characters: Emperor Palpatine, Pyro, Dukey, Mu La Flaga, Mukotsu, Mr. Chang, Aizawa, No-Name of the Brood\n- Organizations: Marvel Comics\n\nFacts:\n- In 1968, The Beatles released the song \"Rocky Raccoon\".\n- Paul McCartney primarily wrote \"Rocky Raccoon\" after being inspired while playing acoustic guitar with John Lennon and Donovan in India during the Beatles' retreat there.\n- Rocket Raccoon's name and aspects of his character are a nod to the 1968 Beatles song \"Rocky Raccoon\".\n- Trevor Devall is best known for voicing Rocket Raccoon in the animated TV series \"Guardians of the Galaxy\".\n- Trevor Devall also voiced Emperor Palpatine in \"Lego Star Wars\", Pyro in \"X-Men Evolution\", and Dukey in seasons 5 and 6 of \"Johnny Test\".\n- Trevor Devall provided various voices in the Netflix original series \"F Is for Family\".\n- Trevor Devall voiced Mu La Flaga in the English-language version of \"Mobile Suit Gundam SEED\", Mukotsu in \"InuYasha\", Mr. Chang in \"Black Lagoon\", and Aizawa in \"Death Note\".\n- No-Name of the Brood is a fictional character in the Marvel Comics Universe.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "19eaaad2-2afd-5159-aaff-a73238008866",
        "text": "Page: Rocket Raccoon. Sentence: His name and aspects of his character are a nod to The Beatles' 1968 song \"Rocky Raccoon\".\nPage: Rocky Raccoon. Sentence: The song was primarily written by Paul McCartney, who was inspired while playing acoustic guitar with John Lennon and Donovan in India (where the Beatles had gone on a retreat).\nPage: Trevor Devall. Sentence: He is best known for voicing Rocket Raccoon in the animated TV series \"Guardians of the Galaxy\", Emperor Palpatine in \"Lego Star Wars\", Pyro in \"X-Men Evolution\", Dukey in seasons 5 and 6 of \"Johnny Test\", and various characters in the Netflix original series \"F Is for Family\", as well as providing voices in English-language versions of various anime series, most notably as Mu La Flaga from \"Mobile Suit Gundam SEED\", Mukotsu from \"InuYasha\", from \"\", Mr. Chang from \"Black Lagoon\", and Aizawa from \"Death Note\".\nPage: No-Name. Sentence: No-Name of the Brood is a fictional character in the Marvel Comics Universe .",
